@startuml
' Compatibility shims: the mandated !theme plain otherwise forces Verdana
' and black/white defaults over the shared style below. These values are
' taken from the shared palette and change no rendered colour.
!$FONT_NAME = "IBM Plex Sans"
!$FGCOLOR = "#1F2A2E"
!$BGCOLOR = "#F7F6F3"
' ---- SHARED STYLE (identical in all five diagrams) ----
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #F7F6F3
skinparam defaultTextColor #1F2A2E
skinparam fontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam fontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
!option handwritten false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 40
skinparam arrowColor #5B6B70

skinparam title {
  FontColor #0E6B66
  FontSize 15
  FontName "IBM Plex Sans"
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #E8F0F9
  BorderColor #24507E
  FontColor #1F2A2E
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FAF9F5
  BorderColor #C5CDD1
  FontColor #1F2A2E
}
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #FAF9F5
  BorderColor #C5CDD1
  FontColor #1F2A2E
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #DCE5D6
  BorderColor #00897B
  FontColor #1F2A2E
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #FAF9F5
  BorderColor #00897B
  FontColor #1F2A2E
}
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F7F6F3
  BorderColor #00897B
  FontColor #0E6B66
}
skinparam entity {
  BackgroundColor #FAF9F5
  BorderColor #00897B
  FontColor #1F2A2E
}
skinparam sequence {
  ActorBackgroundColor #FAF9F5
  ActorBorderColor #00897B
  ActorFontColor #1F2A2E
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FAF9F5
  ParticipantBorderColor #C5CDD1
  ParticipantFontColor #1F2A2E
  LifeLineBorderColor #C5CDD1
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #DCE5D6
  ArrowColor #00897B
  MessageTextColor #1F2A2E
  NoteBackgroundColor #E8F0F9
  NoteBorderColor #24507E
  NoteFontColor #1F2A2E
  BoxBackgroundColor #F7F6F3
  BoxBorderColor #00897B
}
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #DCE5D6
  BorderColor #00897B
  ArrowColor #5B6B70
  FontColor #1F2A2E
}
skinparam activityDiamond {
  BackgroundColor #FBF0D9
  BorderColor #7A4B00
  FontColor #7A4B00
}
' ---- END SHARED STYLE ----

title Sequence — Grounded AI request

actor Caregiver
participant Client as "Client (Android / Web)"
participant Consent as "Consent gate"
participant KeyStore as "Device Keystore"
participant Catalog as "Model catalogue"
participant Provider as "Model provider API"
participant Ground as "Grounding + safety"

autonumber

Caregiver ->> Client: request summary for period
Client ->> Consent: confirm first use
Consent -->> Caregiver: show what leaves the device
Caregiver ->> Consent: grant consent
Client ->> KeyStore: read key for selected provider
KeyStore -->> Client: decrypted key in memory
note over Client, KeyStore: The key never leaves the device.
Client ->> Catalog: resolve model
alt cached list is valid
    Catalog -->> Client: cached model list
else cache missing or stale
    Client ->> Provider: GET /models (OpenRouter only)
    Provider -->> Client: model list
    Client ->> Catalog: filter, dedupe, cap, cache
end
note over Catalog, Provider: Other providers use bundled lists; their /models routes are not called.
Client ->> Provider: bounded completion request
Provider -->> Client: model reply
Client ->> Ground: sanitize, quote evidence, check negation
Ground -->> Client: grounded result + safety flags
Client -->> Caregiver: result with disclaimer

@enduml
